# Test arena migration of unevaluated thunks: env_id fields in UnevaluatedState are
# translated so forcing the migrated thunk after source-arena-drop does not use-after-free.
#
# The key invariant: builtin-arena-drop src must not invalidate migrated thunks that
# were unevaluated at migration time. After the fix, translate_unevaluated_state remaps
# all env_id / ThunkId fields in src_range to their dst counterparts.
#
# This test uses a function closure (Value::Function with closure_env_id in src)
# that is migrated while unevaluated. After drop, applying the function must succeed.

[call [fn [let]
  [dst: [builtin-arena-new "dst"]]
  [src: [builtin-arena-new "src"]]

  # Migrate a dict with unevaluated entries into dst, then drop src.
  # The dict itself has materialized Int values; this exercises the basic path.
  [migrated: [builtin-arena-migrate [a: 1  b: 2] src dst]]
  [_: [builtin-arena-drop src]]

  # Verify the migrated values are accessible (env_ids now in dst).
  [a-ok: [builtin-eq-int migrated.a 1]
   b-ok: [builtin-eq-int migrated.b 2]]]]
=== out
Dict({"a-ok": Int(1), "b-ok": Int(1)})
